0..56 Comment "// A flow with code, which `Path` refuses at its member."
57..59 Comment "//"
60..132 Comment "// `Path` admits a translation only when each of its members renames one"
133..205 Comment "// member, so no code runs at the boundary. The test is on each member\'s"
206..274 Comment "// definition: a member that computes is code, whatever it computes."
275..277 Comment "//"
278..355 Comment "// This file is a site and a manifold at once. `far` requires the older store"
356..431 Comment "// under `store` and under `cache`. The site answers `store` via `keeping`,"
432..510 Comment "// whose `put` drops the write in a definition of its own, and `cache` through"
511..589 Comment "// a renaming. The manifold states `Path`, and the check refuses the placement"
590..666 Comment "// at `store` and names `put`. The file itself settles, and `gandr check` of"
667..707 Comment "// it as a deployment refuses the entry."
708..710 Comment "//"
711..788 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/translations/translated.gandr` — the program, whose"
789..824 Comment "//   `far` requires the older store"
825..903 Comment "// - see: `corpus/model/translations/translated.manifold.gandr` — a renaming"
904..931 Comment "//   under `Path`, admitted"
932..1004 Comment "// - see: `crates/surface-driver/tests/cli.rs` — the check refusing it"
1006..1061 Comment "// The deployment theories, and the translation policy."
